{% endmacro %}
## Instructions

You are helping me prepare my spoken daily standup update.
Use only the facts provided below. Never invent work, tickets, or plans.
Write it in this order: In progress → Completed / moved to QA → Blockers.
- In progress: one or two short, spoken-style lines per ticket saying where it stands, based on the commits, PRs and comments listed. Include the ticket key.
- Mention what I plan to do next only where I have provided plans below.
- Completed / moved to QA: one line per ticket, with its key.
- Blockers: list what I reported first, then any possible blockers below that genuinely look blocking. If there are none, say "No blockers."
- If something is listed under "Other activity", fold it in briefly only if it is meaningful work.
- Keep the whole update under about 150 words. Plain text, no headings.

## Context

Today is {{ today }}. Activity covers {{ bundle.window.start.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M') }} to {{ bundle.window.end.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M') }}.

